  "exactStoredCommitMessage_readback": "feat(explorer): accept guided-question visual study\n\nPreserve original issue #8\u2019s exact accepted twelve-file study, full original C1\u2013C4 and independent quality reports, complete engineering handoff, actual Felipe selection, and local completion evidence. Keep the relationship and timeline comparison lenses; guided-first integration belongs to issue #9 after its native #7 dependency.\n\nThe frozen study document\u2019s pending sentence records its earlier authoring stage; the linked coordinator acceptance checkpoint supplies the subsequent C1\u2013C4 and quality verdicts without rewriting history or adding a source repair.\n\nThis is the second bounded publication slice after the immutable observer proof. Six of twenty original issues are locally accepted; native #4/#7, remote CI, deployment, merge, and the whole roadmap remain unaccepted. Current WISH, unaccepted read-model code, SDK disclosure updates, new native-extension design, and all private credential/account records are intentionally excluded.\n\n",
